                "No connection is needed for ordinary editing. Online AI needs an account with an AI company, a model name and usually a paid API key (a private code for apps). Ollama runs AI on your own computer, so it need not use the internet for each question. It must be running and have a model installed. Performance and privacy depend on the chosen service.",
                "Draft: Write a Markdown meeting agenda with three sections.\n\nRewrite: Make this paragraph shorter without changing its facts: [paste your chosen paragraph].\n\nExplain: Explain why this Markdown table is not aligned: [paste the table].\n\nCheck structure: Suggest clearer headings for this outline; do not invent facts: [paste your outline].",
