                 new("Describe what you want", "Press Ctrl+Shift+Space. In a blank note, describe the draft you want. In Source, select a paragraph before opening the composer to try Rewrite or another editable starter. Read the scope guidance, check the connection and choose Generate for review.", "The composer explains what will be shared. An empty note sends only your instruction."),
